---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/main-layout.astro";
---

<style lang="scss">
    section {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0 16px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .donation-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 24px;
        margin-top: 32px;
        .one-time-donation-link {
            color: #fff;
            background: #635bff88;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            &:hover {
                background: #635bffbb;
            }
        }
        .or {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #aaa;
            font-style: italic;
        }
    }
    .monthly-donation-list {
        display: flex;
        gap: 32px;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    .monthly-donation-link {
        height: 96px;
        width: 96px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        font-size: 0.75em;
        font-family: sans-serif;
        color: #fff;
        background: #635bff88;
        text-decoration: none;
        .dollar-amount {
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        &:hover {
            background: #635bffbb;
        }
    }
    .cancel-info {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-style: italic;
    }
</style>
<MainLayout title="Support | Jetty Radio">
    <h2 class="page-title">Support</h2>
    <section>
        Like what we’re doing and want to show your support? Please consider
        signing up for a recurring donation to help sustain Jetty Radio. Your
        donations will help us throw fun events, acquire much needed gear, and
        maybe even get access to a physical space to stream from!
    </section>
    <section>
        Jetty Radio is a proud community partner of <a
            class="link link-primary"
            target="_blank"
            href="https://www.indexical.org/">Indexical</a
        >, and operates as a 501(c)(3). To make a tax deductible donation or
        monthly contribution, please follow these links to our secure payment
        platform:
        <div class="donation-links">
            <a
                href="https://buy.stripe.com/14AcN4fnQ4vN7MA7NJ7wA06"
                class="one-time-donation-link"
                target="_blank">One-time Donation</a
            >
            <span class="or">or</span>
            <div class="monthly-donation-list">
                <a
                    href="https://buy.stripe.com/8x28wO4Jc1jBff22tp7wA07"
                    class="monthly-donation-link"
                    target="_blank"
                    ><span class="dollar-amount">$1</span><span
                        class="recurrence">per month</span
                    ></a
                >
                <a
                    href="https://buy.stripe.com/bJebJ05Ng4vN0k8ec77wA08"
                    class="monthly-donation-link"
                    target="_blank"
                    ><span class="dollar-amount">$3</span><span
                        class="recurrence">per month</span
                    ></a
                >
                <a
                    href="https://buy.stripe.com/aFa4gyb7A0fx7MA9VR7wA09"
                    class="monthly-donation-link"
                    target="_blank"
                    ><span class="dollar-amount">$5</span><span
                        class="recurrence">per month</span
                    ></a
                >
            </div>
            <span class="cancel-info"
                >Cancel anytime by sending an email to the <a
                    class="link link-primary text-nowrap"
                    href="mailto:jettyradio-organizers@googlegroups.com"
                    >Jetty Radio organizers</a
                >.</span
            >
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>
